From 957a0dcfd94e5c8d5c304ccb42c428d394157086 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redminote11tech <redminote11tech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:17:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] khdf platform drivers + accesstokenid: full OH
 kernel-mode layer

- enable HDF platform drivers (GPIO/I2C/UART/SPI/PWM/ADC/RTC): fix
  framework path in platform makefiles (5-ups -> 3-ups)
- vendor accesstokenid driver from OH 4.19; add task_struct token/ftoken
  fields (sched.h) + fork inheritance (current-> in 4.14, no orig param)
- platform configs enabled in out config
---
