+/*
+ * <FUNCTION DESCRIPTION>
+ *   The  swprintf_s  function  is  the  wide-character  equivalent  of the sprintf_s function
+ *
+ * <INPUT PARAMETERS>
+ *    strDest                   Storage location for the output.
+ *    destMax                   Maximum number of characters to store.
